Third-party notice: Monaspace Neon

Uneri's install script (scripts/install-font.sh) can download the
Monaspace Neon typeface from its upstream project (github.com/githubnext/
monaspace) at install time. Monaspace is licensed separately under the
SIL Open Font License 1.1 by its authors and is NOT redistributed inside
this repository — it is fetched fresh from the upstream release on your
machine, under its own license, only if you don't already have it
installed. See https://github.com/githubnext/monaspace for the font's
license and full attribution.
